#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/color_image_correction/bezier_curves.rst:10
msgid "Bezier Curves"
msgstr "Curvas de Bezier"

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/color_image_correction/bezier_curves.rst:13
msgid "This is the `Frei0r curves <https://www.mltframework.org/plugins/FilterFrei0r-curves/>`_ MLT filter by Maksim Golovkin and Till Theato."
msgstr ""
"Este é o filtro de `curvas de Frei0r <https://www.mltframework.org/plugins/"
"FilterFrei0r-curves/>`_ de MLT de Maksim Golovkin e Till Theato."

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/color_image_correction/bezier_curves.rst:15
msgid "Adjusts luminance or color channel intensity with curve level mapping."
msgstr ""
"Axusta a intensidade das canles de luminancia e de cor con asociacións de "
"niveis de curvas."

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/color_image_correction/bezier_curves.rst:19
msgid "See `TheDiveo blog <http://thediveo-e.blogspot.de/2013/10/grading-of-hero-3-above-waterline.html>`_ for an example of how to use this effect to colour grade clips."
msgstr ""
"Pode consultar na `bitácora de TheDiveo <http://thediveo-e.blogspot.de/2013/"
"10/grading-of-hero-3-above-waterline.html>`_ un exemplo de como usar este "
"efecto para aplicar gradacións de cor a fragmentos."

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/color_image_correction/bezier_curves.rst:21
msgid ":ref:`curves` is also an interface into this Frie0r filter."
msgstr ":ref:`curves` é outra interface deste filtro de Frie0r."
